      "text": "Whereas the Department had published E-tender vide F.No.31/27/2022-E&F(SIA)\ndated 03.02.2022 for the empanelment of agencies to conduct Social Impact Assessment\nstudies at Lakshadweep as per the various provisions in the Right to Fair Compensation\nand Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act-2013 (30 Of\n2013) and Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition,\nRehabilitation and Resettlement (Social Impact Assessment & Consent) Rules 2014."
    },
